{"nodes": [{"id": "readme_architecture_overview", "label": "Full-Stack Architecture Overview", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 7-43", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Frontend (5173) -> Spring Boot (8080) -> FastAPI AI service (8000), with PostgreSQL+pgvector (5433) behind the backend and Qdrant (6333) plus Inngest (8288) behind the AI service, so relational and vector stores are owned by different services."}, {"id": "readme_backend_service", "label": "Spring Boot Backend Service", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 47-49, 155-175", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Documented here as Spring Boot 3.4 on Java 21 with Spring Security, JWT (jjwt 0.12.7), MapStruct 1.6.3, Lombok and Spring AI (Ollama), serving REST at http://localhost:8080/api."}, {"id": "readme_frontend_service", "label": "React + Vite Frontend Service", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 46, 177-206", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "React 18 + TypeScript + Vite 5 + TailwindCSS 3.4 with React Router 6, React Hook Form + Zod, Recharts, Lucide and date-fns, served on port 5173."}, {"id": "readme_ai_service", "label": "FastAPI AI Service (README view)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 48, 208-247", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "FastAPI + Python 3.12 + LlamaIndex + Inngest on port 8000, doing resume ingestion, GPT-4o-mini profile extraction, deterministic scoring (40/20/10/30), RAG summaries with reranked evidence, ranking with explanations and async workflows."}, {"id": "readme_postgres_pgvector", "label": "PostgreSQL 16 with pgvector", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 49", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Holds relational data plus vector embeddings on port 5433; the non-default port avoids collision with a locally installed PostgreSQL."}, {"id": "readme_qdrant_vector_db", "label": "Qdrant Vector Database", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 50", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Qdrant v1.9 on 6333 stores resume chunk embeddings (BGE-M3, 1024-dim), keeping high-volume chunk vectors out of the transactional database."}, {"id": "readme_inngest_workflows", "label": "Inngest Async Workflow Engine", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 51", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chosen for async job processing with retries on port 8288, so long-running LLM and embedding work survives failures instead of being lost in a request-scoped thread."}, {"id": "readme_env_configuration", "label": "Service Environment Variable Reference", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 249-282", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Backend requires JWT_SECRET (min 32 chars), mail and datasource settings plus AI_SERVICE_URL; the AI service requires OPENAI_API_KEY and SPRING_BOOT_BASE_URL while EMBEDDING_PROVIDER and RERANKER_PROVIDER default to local so the stack runs without paid embedding calls."}, {"id": "readme_troubleshooting", "label": "Troubleshooting Runbook", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 333-389", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Documents the recurring failure modes: database connection refused, Qdrant unreachable, BGE-M3 failing to load (fall back to EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=o